{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまさんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しくドジかまして、駅にポーチをおいてけぼりにして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっ(゜-゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"となって気づいて今取りに戻ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事にポーチを発見し安心してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ暑いけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋ですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜかというと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまのくしゃみが止まらないからです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう花粉的なもの舞ってるんだな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も少しお仕事あったけど、ゆっくり過ごす１日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く寒くなってほしいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/5085067/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。\n素晴らしい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}